#. なになになになに？　何か面白い事言った？
#. それとも、アタシが言ったのかしらん？
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"What what what what!? Did you say something funny? Did\n"
"I!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. フン…それがどうした。
#. 俺の言ってる事に何か間違いがあるか？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmph. What, you think there's some mistake lurking in\n"
"what I said?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に…ジェノサイダー翔が犯人なのか？
#. 何か違う気がするけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is Genocide Jack really the killer? I feel like\n"
"something doesn't match up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ、不二咲さんの死体を思い出してみよう…
#. そうすれば、ハッキリするはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay, I have to just focus on remembering Chihiro's\n"
"body. That must have the answer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの人の発言が間違いだって事に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That should prove that what he said isn't quite\n"
"right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
